 "description": "Attach passively to one exact approved Node/Electron V8 Inspector target and capture bounded Debugger.scriptParsed plus Runtime execution-context events. REA sends only Runtime.enable and Debugger.enable: it never evaluates, pauses, resumes, reads source, or instruments the target. require/import edges, EventEmitter activity, and Electron IPC remain explicit unknowns; reconcile the returned Evidence with static Application Graph Evidence using reconcile_javascript_runtime.",
